From: Denys Vitali <denys@denv.it>
Subject: [PATCH] mm: vmalloc: export __vmalloc_node_range_noprof for pvrsgx

The openpvrsgx tree (pvrsrvkm-7.1) carries this export. pvrsgx-1.17.patch.xz
only has drivers/gpu/drm/pvrsgx, so the modules fail modpost:
"__vmalloc_node_range_noprof" [...pvrsrvkm_omap4_sgx540_120.ko] undefined.
---
--- a/mm/vmalloc.c	2026-11-18 11:13:14.075196871 +0000
+++ b/mm/vmalloc.c	2026-11-18 11:13:14.111196397 +0000
@@ -4101,6 +4101,7 @@
 
 	return NULL;
 }
+EXPORT_SYMBOL(__vmalloc_node_range_noprof);
 
 /**
  * __vmalloc_node - allocate virtually contiguous memory
